    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Solomon otyeko gero ot pa Rwot, ki ode en kabaka, ki odi mukene ducu ma onoŋo en mitogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 3.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 1.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Rwot dok onen bote tyen me aryone, kit ma yam onen bote i Gibeon ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owacce ni, “Atyeko winyo legani, ki bako dogi ma iketo i nyima; atyeko lonyo ot man ma igero-ni obed maleŋ, aketo iye nyina wek obed iye matwal; dok waŋa ki cwinya bikemo kunnu nino ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki ma tuŋ boti, ka ce ibibedo ki kit kwo i nyima ma yam woru Daudi obedo kwede-ni, kun ii Ien dok cwinyi atir, ce ka itiyo gin ma aciko ducu kun igwoko cik ma aketo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci an Lubaŋani abimoko komkerri me loyo jo Icrael matwal, kit ma yam aciko bot woru Daudi-ni kun awaco bote ni, ‘Pe ibibedo laboŋo danoni mo ma bibedo i wi komker me Icrael.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka ce in nyo likwayi wunak wuweko lubo kora, ma wukwero mako lok ma aciko ki cik ma aketo i nyimwu, ce wukobo woko ka tiyo bot lubaŋa mogo mukene kun wuworogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci miyo abityekojo Icrael woko ki i lobo ma yam amiyo botgi-ni; dok abikwanyo waŋa woko, pe doŋ aneno ot man, ma doŋ alonyo bedo maleŋ pi nyina-ni; miyo nyiŋ jo Icrael bi doko carolok ki lok aboka i kin rok ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 25.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 36.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ot man bi doko obur ma odurre lipim; miyo dano ducu ma gibikato ka ŋete gibiuro ki jwat kun giwacci, ‘Kit lok aŋo ma omiyo Rwot otimo lobo-ni ki ot man ki tim macalo man?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok gibiwacci, ‘Pien gubwoto Rwot Lubaŋagi ma yam okwanyo kwarogi ki i lobo Ejipt, ci gukobo i te loc pa lubaŋa mogo mukene, dok gubedo ka worogi ma kun gitiyo botgi bene; en aye lok mumiyo Rwot omiyo can opoto i komgi magwa-ni.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gero odi aryo-ni ma Solomon ogero, gin aye ot pa Rwot ki ot pa kabaka, otero mwaka pyeraryo kulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun Kiram kabaka me Turo obedo ka miyo bot Solomon bao yat cedar ki bao yat ciprec, ki jabu bene kit ma en mito ducu. Lacen ka doŋ otum Solomon omiyo bot Kiram gaŋi pyeraryo ma i lobo Galilaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i kare ma Kiram oa ki i Turo ocito ka neno gaŋi ma Solomon omiyo bote-ni, oneno gaŋine pe guyomo cwinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiram owaco bot Solomon ni, “Omera, man kono kit gaŋi aŋo ma imiya-ni?” Kit meno omiyo lobone gilwoŋo ni Kabul nio wa onyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiram onoŋo yam ocwalo bot Solomon jabu ma romo talanta miya acel ki pyeraryo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye lok i kom tic muroni ma kabaka Solomon omiyo girono pi gero ot pa Rwot, ki ode kikome, ki Millo, ki cel me Jerucalem, kacel ki gaŋi magi, Kajor, Megido ki Gejer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo Parao kabaka me Ejipt yam ocito omako Gejer ka owaŋo woko ki mac, ka dok oneko Lukaanan ma gibedo’ i gaŋ meno ci omiyo bot nyare ma Solomon onyomo, wek obed mot me nyommegi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Solomon ogero Gejer odoco, Girono bene dano pi gero Betkoron Mapiny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kacel ki Baalat, Tamar ma tye i tim me lobo Juda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki gaŋi ducu me kano cam ma yam Solomon tye kwedgi, ki gaŋi me gadigadine me mony, gaŋi pa lulweny ma giriŋo ki aguragurane, ki kit gedo ducu ma Solomon omito gerogi i Jerucalem ki i Lebanon ki i lobo ma en loyo ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likwayo pa jo ma pe gin jo Icrael ma yam gubwot ci gudoŋ i lobo ki i kom jo Amor, jo Kit, jo Perej, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ma jwerogi woko liweŋ yam oloyo jo Icrael, gin aye Solomon oketo tic muroni i wigi macalo gin opii, kit macalo tye-ni nio wa onyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Solomon pe omiyo jo Icrael tiyo tic macalo opii: gin gubedo askarine, ki ludito ticce, ludito wi mony, lukapten, ludito ma loyo gadigadi lweny, ki lulweny ma riŋo ki aguragura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
